        "ه من تذكر) (2) فقال: توبيخ لابن ثماني عشرة سنة (3)."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bilal-muhammad": [
          "Al-Sadiq (as) was asked about the saying of Allah, “Did We not give you lives long enough so that whoever wanted to be mindful could have done so?” <a href=\"/books/quran:35#h37\">[35:37]</a> So, he said: A rebuke to one who has reached eighteen years of age."
        ]
      }
